sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Application
    participant V as Reader node
    participant N as Nodes closest to the DID
    A->>V: get(DID)
    alt the reader holds a valid local copy
        rect rgba(47, 143, 78, 0.08)
        Note over V: returned at once, no network
        end
    else no local copy
        V->>N: FIND_VALUE(key), iterative
        N-->>V: record, or closer nodes
        Note over V: the first record whose key is in the tree at its position<br/>and whose signature verifies wins, no vote.<br/>A record that fails is discarded, nothing is stored
    end
    V-->>A: record at position N
    Note over A: compares the public key with the key<br/>in the Verifiable Credential, which names position M above N
    opt the key fails the credential
        rect rgba(91, 127, 174, 0.08)
        A->>V: repair(DID, record N, M, SHA-256 of key M)
        V->>N: FIND_VALUE(key), iterative, at most 5 s
        N-->>V: records: copies of N, lower ones, M, or higher
        Note over V: the first verified record at M with key M,<br/>unless a verified higher one came first,<br/>stored by the replica rules
        V-->>A: record M, or nothing
        end
    end
